th, etc. under the Stonex, Ashwamed, Prostowin, Suswas, Menoleap, and Ayursulin brands; anti-hypertensive, anti-lipidemic, and anti-obese products; skin care and bone health products; herbal liver protective and antioxidant; and cardiac care products under the Secremet and Servace brands. In addition, the company offers a range of APIs for therapeutic areas, such as anti-histamine, platelet inhibitor, anti-diabetic, anti-convulsant, urinary incontinence, neuropathic pain, anti-allergy, anti-inflammatory, diuretic, and acne treatment, etc.; and various formulations, including tablets, capsules, syrups, suspensions, ophthalmic, creams, and ointments. Further, it engages in the treatment of gastrointestinal disorders; and piles, fistula, and constipation. The company exports its products to approximately 30 countries. Bal Pharma Limited was incorporated in 1987 and is based in Bengaluru, India."}}